306 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Our recruitment efforts are focused on being a visible and welcoming presence for new and prospective students. We are active at major campus events like UCLA Bruin Day, the Latinx Welcome, and the Enormous Activities Fair. A cornerstone of this effort is our First-Year Admit Weekend, where admitted students are hosted by our members, giving them an authentic preview of life as a UCLA Engineering student and a member of the SOLES familia. We kick off each academic year with a large social event, like our Tri-Org Beach Day, to build community from day one.)
/E (Our recruitment efforts are focused on being a visible and welcoming presence for new and prospective students. We are active at major campus events like UCLA Bruin Day, the Latinx Welcome, and the Enormous Activities Fair. A cornerstone of this effort is our First-Year Admit Weekend, where admitted students are hosted by our members, giving them an authentic preview of life as a UCLA Engineering student and a member of the SOLES familia. We kick off each academic year with a large social event, like our Tri-Org Beach Day, to build community from day one.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
