308 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Navigating college life is difficult, but our MentorSHPE program ensures no member does it alone. We pair underclassmen with upperclassmen in "familias" to provide guidance on everything from choosing classes to balancing academics and socializing. This program is the heart of our retention strategy, fostering strong 1-on-1 relationships that create a supportive and personal community network. Through engaging activities like pumpkin carving, holiday gift exchanges, and friendly competitions, these familias build the bonds that make SOLES a home away from home.)
/E (Navigating college life is difficult, but our MentorSHPE program ensures no member does it alone. We pair underclassmen with upperclassmen in "familias" to provide guidance on everything from choosing classes to balancing academics and socializing. This program is the heart of our retention strategy, fostering strong 1-on-1 relationships that create a supportive and personal community network. Through engaging activities like pumpkin carving, holiday gift exchanges, and friendly competitions, these familias build the bonds that make SOLES a home away from home.)
