/S /P
/E (We are committed to fostering a welcoming environment for every member of our community. Our SHPEtinas Initiative creates a tight-knit community for our Latina engineers to share experiences and support one another through picnics, study outings, and dedicated networking events. Similarly, our Transfer Representative ensures our transfer student community feels at home by organizing transfer-specific socials, movie nights, and dinner dates, helping them build connections with peers who understand the unique transfer experience.)
/Pg 23 0 R
